Builds into `dist/`, serves it, and rebuilds on change; with `--platform tui`, builds the terminal app and runs it here

Usage: leptoskit dev [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --open                 Open the browser after the server starts
      --port <PORT>          Serve on a different port than the configuration says
      --platform <PLATFORM>  The platform to run: `web` (or `server`) serves the site, and `tui` runs the terminal app in this terminal. Defaults to the configuration's
  -h, --help                 Print help
  -V, --version              Print version
